    <briefdescription>
<para>Wave D dedicated benchmark gates for acceleration module hot paths. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Gates ACC-BM-01..04 lock the acceptable performance envelope for the acceleration module Wave D operability deliverables.</para>
<para>Wave D Acceleration Benchmark Gates ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── ACC-BM-01 GPU→CPU fallback routing decision latency ≤ 1 µs (per-call) ACC-BM-02 Kernel dispatch enqueue/dequeue latency ≤ 1 µs (per-call) ACC-BM-03 CPU fallback executor throughput ≥ 1 000 ops/sec ACC-BM-04 Concurrent kernel dispatch (8 workers) ≥ 500 ops/sec total</para>
<sect1 id="bench__acceleration__dedicated__gates_8cpp_1autotoc_md2_1s1"><sect2 id="bench__acceleration__dedicated__gates_8cpp_1autotoc_md2">
